21
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,400
A reference architecture.

22
00:01:24,020 --> 00:01:28,280
Yeah. It's essentially a master blueprint for how all government technology connects.

23
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:34,300
When you build alone across the whole government, you're paying multiple times for the exact same capability.

